---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Credits">
  <main class="max-w-180 mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl mb-8">Credits</h1>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
      <p>Irregular Pearl is built with work generously shared by others. We thank the artists, institutions, and projects listed here.</p>

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink pt-4">Images</h2>
      <p><strong class="text-ink">Landing page background.</strong> Original image: <cite>Bacchanale Revel, Pan and Procession</cite> by Louis Schaettle, from the <a class="text-accent underline" href="https://americanart.si.edu/" rel="noopener">Smithsonian American Art Museum</a>, released under <a class="text-accent underline" href="https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/" rel="noopener">CC0</a>. Edited by Irregular Pearl.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
